      "text": "Every tick: subscribed inputs + output safety\nDue: interested topology / idle physical checks\nDue: timers / KV expiry / status animation\nDue or dirty: open UI / retained service jobs\n\nKeep existing latency and work envelopes.\nDelayed idle checks never authorize a call.",
